      "writtenOn": "2021-03-10T14:34:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Doesn\u0027t this rather belong in testing.go? Things like the assertion tests below don\u0027t have that much to do with fixtures after all. There are also a few functions of that sort in there already, e.g. FailIfNoMatchingErrors.",
